OL,3,GNEWSAThe school where white
OL,4,Aworking-class pupils defy the odds
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe school where white working-class
OL,7,Fpupils defy the odds
OL,9,FTwo years ago, I stood in a school hall
OL,10,Fin Sunderland on GCSE results day and
OL,11,Fwatched the pride and surprise in the
OL,12,Ffaces of teenagers as the envelopes
OL,13,Fwere opened.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/3
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,400,390,260,160,0,100
PN,39902
SC,0002
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F399A1794579957
OL,1,W5j 5Q7kjs1 wsj#57sj  w{j#57i
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$ -,* %-.*,$%** %-& (,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAThe school where white
OL,4,Aworking-class pupils defy the odds
OL,5,
OL,6,FEven after years of covering results
OL,7,Fdays, I was emotional to see a set of
OL,8,Foutstanding results in a school facing
OL,9,Fso many challenges. Almost half of the
OL,10,Fschool's pupils receive free school
OL,11,Fmeals, meaning their parents are on low
OL,12,Fincomes. In fact, the results in the
OL,13,Fex-mining town of Hetton-le-Hole were
OL,14,Fas strong as the most affluent parts of
OL,15,Fsouthern England.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/3
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,400,390,260,160,0,100
PN,39903
SC,0003
