PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F399A1794579957
OL,1,W5j 5Q7kjs1 wsj#57sj  w{j#57i
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$ -,* %-.*,$%** %-& (,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAThe school where white
OL,4,Aworking-class pupils defy the odds
OL,5,
OL,6,FThis summer, Hetton Academy hit another
OL,7,Fmilestone, with 80% of its pupils
OL,8,Fgetting a pass of at least a grade 4 in
OL,9,Fmaths and English. A grade 4 is roughly
OL,10,Fequivalent to a 'C' under the old
OL,11,Fsystem, and is seen as a passport to
OL,12,Fjobs and further education.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/3
